sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Proprio
    participant Vault
    participant Supabase
    User->>Proprio: Select Supabase method and agent access
    alt Hosted MCP browser sign-in
        Proprio->>Supabase: Read protected resource and issuer metadata
        Proprio->>Supabase: Register instance OAuth client
        Proprio->>User: Open authorization URL
        User->>Supabase: Choose organization and consent
        Supabase->>Proprio: Instance callback with authorization code
        Proprio->>Supabase: Exchange code with PKCE
    else Personal access token
        User->>Proprio: Enter token and optional or required project reference
    end
    Proprio->>Vault: Store selected grant credential
    Proprio->>Supabase: MCP discovery or native project probe
    User->>Proprio: Set action permissions
    Proprio->>Proprio: Authorize agent run and selected grant
    Proprio->>Vault: Resolve selected invocation credential
    Proprio->>Supabase: Invoke permitted action
    Proprio->>Proprio: Record bounded result and audit
